     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi everyone,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The UC Davis Library is having a Data Carpentry Workshop on January 3-4, 9:00-4:00 in the DSI Classroom.  We had an enormous response and are in need of more helpers.  I could use 3 to 4 more helpers for both days.  We’re teaching spreadsheets,\r\n Open Refine, and Intro to R.  Lunch and snacks will be provided!  If you are interested, please email me back with your availability.  I very much appreciate it!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Workshop website: <a href=\"https://micheletobias.github.io/2019-01-03-Davis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://micheletobias.github.io/2019-01-03-Davis/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466209332000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RaZfPZQm44fGub2MPStwJ\">\r\nhttps://micheletobias.github.io/2019-01-03-Davis/</a> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Michele<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">GIS Data Curator<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466209332000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34jMqF7cXYzTAbLU9qN7J4\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">Data Management Program</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u>